(44956,'Noel Padgham-Purich   Cyril Rioli','Cecilia Noel Padgham-Purich AM: Born 25 December 1927, Quairading, Western Australia\nCareer: Member, Northern Territory Legislative Assembly (1977–1997); Represented Tiwi (1977–1983), Koolpinyah (1983–1990), and Nelson (1990–1997); Minister for Housing and Conservation (1983–1984)\n\nCyril Rioli: Born ?\nCareer: Footballer (Uncertain, and also not the Cyril Rioli born 1989 who plays football, but possibly his father \"Cyril Jr.\" or perhaps his father (presumably Cyril Sr.))\n\nNoel Padgham-Purich was elected in 1977 for Tiwi.'),
